<title>ISRAEL: Africa Israel 1996 net down.</title>
<headline>Africa Israel 1996 net down.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Africa Israel Investments Ltd.</p>
<p>			   (in millions of shekels)</p>
<p>			  Q4 96	Q4 95	12-MTH 96  12-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		 144.65     254.77     963.6	832.48</p>
<p>Operating profit     12.54	46.87     125.3	142.37</p>
<p>Net Profit		8.39	29.12	74.9	114.0</p>
<p>The 1996 results were adjusted to reflect the distribution of the company's shares in Leumi Insurance Holdings to Africa Israel shareholders.</p>
<p>Africa Israel's total assets rose to 2.71 billion shekels from 2.63 billion in 1996 while equity capital grew to 1.2 billion shekels from 1.14 billion.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.37 shekels</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
